( F5 T4 U9f: reactivation with a geometric container: element 2 lies
  inside element 3 of group 1 (own nodes 11-14), is removed at 10 into the
  inactive state, its nodes 7 8 belonging to no active element; the remove
  of 20 does not remove it, so it is active again. Factor 0 with
  _activate_all -yes (the zero start of the Professional): node dofs =
  Professional 02-08-2026 default run. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
